  "content": "\n\n<h1>Pufferfish API</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Octagon-Modding/Pufferfish-API/actions/workflows/build-neo-26.2.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Octagon-Modding/Pufferfish-API/actions/workflows/build-neo-26.2.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"Java CI（使用 Gradle）\" width=\"184\" height=\"20\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/repo-size/Octagon-Modding/Pufferfish-API\" alt=\"GitHub 仓库大小\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpufferfish-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/3d9M7tAN?logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth Downloads&color=green\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pufferfish-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1205309?logo=curseforge&logoColor=black&label=CurseForge Downloads&labelColor=cc7000&color=blue\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></a></p>\n<p>Pufferfish API 是一个库类模组，旨在简化使用单一代码库开发跨版本、跨加载器模组的过程。该库主要为我自己的模组（BTA 除外）构建，因此随时可能出现问题，你可能不应该基于此开发自己的模组。此外，它不会添加任何游戏内容，因此仅当你的某个模组依赖于此库时才应安装它。</p>\n<h2>当前支持的 Minecraft 版本与加载器：</h2>\n<table style=\"width:59.3985%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:19.9664%\"><img src=\"https://fabricmc.net/assets/logo.png\" alt=\"Fabric 标志\">Fabric</th>\n<th style=\"width:45.9916%\"><img src=\"https://neoforged.net/img/content/branding/banner.png\" alt=\"NeoForged 标志\" width=\"217\" height=\"45\"></th>\n<th style=\"width:33.7553%\"><img src=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/static/images/logo.svg\" alt=\"Forge 标志\" width=\"159\" height=\"35\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:19.9664%\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pufferfish-api/download/8259917\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">26.2</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:45.9916%\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pufferfish-api/download/8259920\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">26.2</a></td>\n<t